## Required design contract

Formal H capture must separate three information domains.

### 1. Observer-visible during blind run

May include only information needed to operate and record the test without revealing or trivially identifying the candidate, for example:

- anonymous label A/B/C;
- scenario ID/version;
- deterministic run controls that are intentionally visible;
- session/run/capture ID;
