# REM-007 — Harden completion, implementation ownership and validation-precondition controls

## Objective

Add small, enforceable repository controls that prevent the classes of process failure identified by F03, F17 and F18 from recurring:

- premature/overbroad issue closure;
- duplicate or overlapping implementation ownership;
- validation that passes/fails under an execution environment that no longer exercises the property its name implies.

This is not a governance rewrite. Prefer compact repository-native checks/templates/records that agents actually consume.

## Canonical RAG / required reading

After #80 lands, treat as governing:

- `docs/operations/development-claims-remediation-programme.md`;
- `docs/audits/2026-09-20-development-claims-closure-audit.md`.

