Do not rewrite those events as though the new controls existed at the time.

The purpose is to prevent recurrence and improve current interpretation, not sanitize history.

## Non-scope

- no reopening/closing of physics issues solely because of the new template;
- no body/player/Water semantic implementation;
- no blanket branch lock;
- no mandatory single-threaded development programme;
